@KimoBruddah-ki2oo This is a UK review, where the BYD is more expensive than the Tesla. I’m aware that is probably the result of tariffs but I believe that the BYD costs about 80% as much as the Tesla in China, so “half the price” is a total exaggeration. The BYD is about 80% as good as the Tesla so that seems about right.

As for “much better car”, well the BYD lost all objective comparisons in this test, and only managed to win on a few of the subjective comparisons (“sleeker”, yeah right!). It also lost overall.

Also, I’ve owned a Tesla Model 3 for 6 years and I’ve had zero problems. It’s been perfect!

